The '''Honed Shark Tooth Necklace''' is a {{Rare}} [[Accessories|Accessory]]. It increases the player's {{stat|str}} by {{Green|6}} and grants {{green|+15%}} chance to get Shark Teeth during [[Fishing Festival|Fishing Festivals]]. It has the appearance of a blue necklace with shark teeth attached to it.

